            "widgets_values": [
              "## klein-still-draft-lab-example\n\nFirst-run Klein 4B still (Apache 2.0 distilled FP8).\nModels: flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors + qwen_3_4b.safetensors (CLIP type flux2) + flux2-vae.safetensors.\nWidgets: seed 42 fixed \u00b7 CFG 1.0 \u00b7 4 steps \u00b7 768x432 \u00b7 batch 2.\nSaveImage prefix: ez_still_draft.\n\nQueue this first. Then open klein-still-hero-lab-example with the same seed for 1280x720.\nAspect widgets: YouTube 16:9 default; Shorts 9:16 = 432x768; 1:1 = 768x768.\nPrompt enhance is on by default (on-box Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507). After Queue, the Enhance node shows the prompt CLIP used (or a passthrough reason). Turn Enhance off to use the widget text as-is. Optional style dropdown.\n\nOccupancy: klein \u2014 stop Wan, LTX, podcast, music. One GB10 job.\n"
            ],
